    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1950" root="بدأ" body-key="b">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ابدأ</span></b> : see 1, in seven places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>He
did a new thing; a thing unknown before;</i> or <i>a
strange,</i> or <i>wonderful, thing.</i> (S, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
<i>He voided excrement,</i> or <i>ordure;</i> or <i>broke wind;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجَا</span>; [as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْدَى</span>;] said of a man. (M.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <i>He put forth his second teeth;</i> said of a
child; (M;) and of a colt. (TA voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْفَرَ</span>, q. v.)

